  - m_Id: 191005000000000
    m_Localized: PUNCH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000001
    m_Localized: Place an item on the table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000002
    m_Localized: Select a knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000003
    m_Localized: Select the GastroPan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000004
    m_Localized: Select the prepared ingredient pile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000005
    m_Localized: 'Customers can ask for drinks only if you add drinks to today''s menu. Drinks are optional extras: even when a customer asks for one, you can complete the main sushi order without serving it. Serving drinks earns extra money.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000006
    m_Localized: 'Customers can ask for side dishes only if you add side dishes to today''s menu. Side dishes are optional extras: even when a customer asks for one, you can complete the main sushi order without serving it. Serving side dishes earns extra money.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000007
    m_Localized: Inside a fish…? That’s not ordinary. Let me see… Hmm. This compass doesn’t follow the surface. It’s tuned to the deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000008
    m_Localized: Not north. Not south. It points to a signal—like a whisper underwater. If it’s reacting down there… it’s guiding you to something hidden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000009
    m_Localized: Daily Special
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000010
    m_Localized: Sushi, side dishes, or beverages with this badge sell for a higher price today. Add the item to your menu to use the bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000011
    m_Localized: Container is empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000012
    m_Localized: Container is full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000013
    m_Localized: The tray slot is already occupied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000014
    m_Localized: This item cannot be placed on the tray.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000015
    m_Localized: This item does not belong in this container.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000016
    m_Localized: This action cannot be completed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 191005000000017
    m_Localized: This fridge must be repaired first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 202608160000000
    m_Localized: Your Diving Suit must be Level {0} in this cave!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515776
    m_Localized: Prep Station
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515777
    m_Localized: "Prepare raw ingredients here.\n\nSelect a cuttable ingredient from your inventory using 1–4, then place it on the Prep Station. Choose the cut type by clicking a knife, such as Long Strip or Nigiri Cut.\n\nFollow the cut markers to prepare the ingredient. When the cutting is complete, place the prepared ingredient into the Gastro Pan on the Prep Station. Then take the Gastro Pan to the Chef Desk and place it there to use the ingredient in recipes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515778
    m_Localized: Chef Desk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515779
    m_Localized: "Make sushi here.\n\nFirst, place the required ingredients on the Chef Desk. Prepared ingredients from the Prep Station should be brought in Gastro Pans, while ingredients like Rice and Nori can be added directly when needed.\n\nSelect a recipe from the recipe book, then follow the recipe steps on the table. Click the correct Gastro Pans or ingredients in order to build the sushi.\n\nWhen all steps are complete, the sushi will be plated and ready to serve."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515780
    m_Localized: Fish Fridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515781
    m_Localized: "Store caught fish here.\n\nPlace the fish you catch inside the Fish Fridge to keep your seafood stock organized and easy to access. Use it as a dedicated storage spot before preparing fish at other stations."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515782
    m_Localized: Beverage Fridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515783
    m_Localized: "Store beverages here.\n\nPlace drinks inside the Beverage Fridge to keep them organized and easy to access during service. Use it as a dedicated storage spot for your drink stock."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515784
    m_Localized: Harpoon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515785
    m_Localized: "Use the Harpoon to catch sea creatures while diving.\n\nHold Right Mouse Button to aim, then press Left Mouse Button to fire. A successful hit hooks the creature and starts a catch challenge.\n\nFollow the on-screen prompts and press Left Mouse Button at the right moments to pull the creature closer. Complete the challenge before time runs out to secure your catch.\n\nHold Right Mouse Button during the challenge if you want to cancel the attempt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515786
    m_Localized: Fishing Rod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515787
    m_Localized: "Use the Fishing Rod to catch fish from the shore.\n\nHold Left Mouse Button to charge your cast, then release it to cast the line. Longer casts can reach deeper fishing zones and different fish.\n\nWhen a fish bites, hold Left Mouse Button to reel it in. Watch the fish's movement and move your mouse in the opposite direction to keep control of the line. Release the button when necessary to avoid losing the fish.\n\nOnce the fish is caught, press Interact to collect it. Hold Right Mouse Button to cancel the current fishing attempt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3428928989515788
    m_Localized: Okay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3435592144736256
    m_Localized: Welcome to the EARLY ACCESS!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3435592144736257
    m_Localized: "This is an early version of the game, so you may encounter bugs, missing content, or unfinished features.\n\nPlease explore, play naturally, and share any feedback about confusing moments, bugs, balance, or things that feel fun.\n\nThank you for helping us improve the game."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
