  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 1778453897880797184
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Chef desk mode toggle button; enters or exits Custom Sushi
          mode, not a finished food item.
    - rid: 1778453897880797185
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Button selecting maki as the custom sushi shape/type; Japanese
          sushi term stays as a name.
    - rid: 1778453897880797186
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Button selecting uramaki as the custom sushi shape/type; Japanese
          sushi term stays as a name.
    - rid: 1778453897880797187
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Button selecting temaki as the custom sushi shape/type; Japanese
          sushi term stays as a name.
    - rid: 1778453897880797188
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Button ending ingredient placement and moving to rolling/cutting;
          does not save the recipe.
    - rid: 1778453897880797189
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Button saving the completed custom sushi as a recipe; not
          saving the whole game.
    - rid: 1778453897880797190
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Label above the custom recipe name field. A blank name is
          allowed and generates an automatic name.
    - rid: 1778453897880797191
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Placeholder in optional custom recipe name input; asks player
          to name the recipe.
    - rid: 1778453897880797192
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Cancels the custom recipe save prompt; not the sushi-making
          mode.
    - rid: 1778453897880797193
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Recipe detail card title. {0}=Maki/Uramaki/Temaki; {1}=number
          of fillings already placed; {2}=maximum fillings. Keep placeholders unchanged.
    - rid: 1778453897880797194
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Center-desk instruction after finished sushi spawns; ask player
          to save its recipe.
    - rid: 1778453897880797195
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Center-desk instruction to choose Maki, Uramaki, or Temaki
          before placing ingredients.
    - rid: 1778453897880797196
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Center-desk instruction for the next required base ingredient.
          {0}=localized ingredient name, e.g. Nori or Rice. Keep placeholder.
    - rid: 1778453897880797197
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Center-desk instruction when maximum fillings have been placed;
          proceed to rolling/cutting, not recipe saving.
    - rid: 1778453897880797198
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Center-desk instruction. {0}=fillings placed; {1}=maximum
          fillings. Player may add another filling or finish now. Keep placeholders.
    - rid: 1778453897880797199
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Toast when attempting to switch between normal and custom
          ChefDesk modes while a composition is active.
    - rid: 1778453897880797200
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toast: selected item is not an eligible processed ingredient;
          nothing is consumed.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797201
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toast: Nori/Rice must be placed in the required order for
          the selected sushi type; nothing is consumed.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797202
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toast: Rice and Nori cannot be added again as fillings; nothing
          is consumed.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797203
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toast: no more filling placements allowed; nothing is consumed.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797204
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toast: composition cannot be edited after finishing/locking;
          not a recipe-save warning.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797205
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toast: sushi type must be selected before placing ingredients.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797206
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toast: required Nori and Rice base placements have not both
          been completed.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797207
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Success toast: player-created recipe was saved, not just
          the dish produced.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797208
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toast: identical ingredient composition is already a known
          recipe, so a duplicate recipe is not saved.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797209
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Failure toast: saving the recipe failed; not a cooking failure.'
    - rid: 1778453897880797210
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Toast after custom sushi dish spawns; its ingredient composition
          has no existing recipe and can be saved.
    - rid: 1778453897880797211
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Toast after dish spawns; composition matches an existing recipe,
          so saving a duplicate is unavailable.
    - rid: 1778453897880797212
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Toast after a custom dish is moved away; desk can begin a
          new custom ingredient composition.
